#, no-wrap
msgid "explore the transpilation pipeline through the full process of creating, transpiling, and submitting circuits."
msgstr "回路の作成・トランスパイル・送信の全プロセスを通じて、トランスパイルのパイプラインを探索します。"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare transpiler settings"
msgstr "トランスパイラー設定の比較"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/circuit-transpilation-settings.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/circuit-transpilation-settings.ipynb\" />\n"

